## Update Checklist

Before publishing any EdgeX update:

1. **Fetch from DefiLlama API:**
   - [ ] `api.llama.fi/protocol/edgex` for TVL
   - [ ] `api.llama.fi/summary/fees/edgex` for fees/revenue
   - Extract: TVL by chain, 24h/7d/30d fees, all-time fees

2. **Check TGE status:**
   - [ ] Has token launched? (Expected Q4 2025)
   - [ ] If yes, fetch from CoinGecko
   - [ ] If no, note "TGE pending"

3. **Update report metrics:**
   - [ ] TVL total and by chain
   - [ ] Fee/revenue data (24h, 7d, 30d, all-time)
   - [ ] Market position vs Hyperliquid, Aster, Lighter
   - [ ] eLP vault performance if available

4. **Update footnotes:**
   - [ ] Note "retrieved via DefiLlama API" for all API data
   - [ ] Add 🔷 HARD DATA markers

5. **Citation check:**
   - [ ] Every footnote `[^N]:` has at least one `[^N]` reference in body
   - [ ] Run: `grep -o '\[\^[0-9]*\]' edgex.md | sort -u | wc -l`
   - [ ] Result should be 55+ (matching footnote count)

6. **Quality check:**
   - [ ] All numbers consistent across report
   - [ ] No confusion between TVL and volume
   - [ ] StarkEx (not StarkNet) mentioned correctly

